&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and execute the strategic roadmap for product data foundations and analytics capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee the design and implementation of scalable data pipelines, data models, and analytics solutions that transform raw product event logs into canonical datasets and insightful data marts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Data Science, Product, and Engineering leadership to understand data needs and translate them into technical requirements&lt;/p&gt;
