bvp-axonius:greenhouse:7749987003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Austin, TX, hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Partner Marketing Specialist acts as the project engine driving North America co-marketing campaigns and alliance partner programs to generate pipeline and deepen ecosystem relationships. Working within a tight-knit cross-functional framework alongside Partner Marketing, Partner Leadership, and Strategic Events teams, this role translates partner strategy into tactical execution plans. The position serves as a primary logistical launchpad for a long-term career path in Partner Marketing within the cybersecurity industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and project-manage joint marketing campaigns, webinars, digital programs, and event activations with ISV and technology alliance partners from execution through to metrics reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage partner portal content, campaign-in-a-box assets, Canva templates, and co-branded material libraries to support partner sales representatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain program documentation, campaign calendars, partner activity logs, and extract data pulls to support quarterly business review (QBR) preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate daily with internal field marketing, content, web, demand generation, and design teams to align timelines and execute deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience working in B2B marketing, specifically within partner, field, demand generation, or campaign marketing roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience managing project timelines, tracking deliverables, and coordinating multiple stakeholder follow-ups simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience utilizing marketing and CRM systems including Salesforce, Marketo, and Splash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing marketing projects and assets using Canva, Allocadia, and ZIP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience directly supporting or coordinating partner, channel, or integration ecosystem marketing programs (Reseller, integration, &amp;amp; cloud providers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional marketing experience within the cybersecurity or SaaS industry sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with partner portals or dedicated ecosystem software tools such as Impartner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of executing end-to-end demand generation campaigns with a direct focus on pipeline metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating physical events, digital webinars, or digital campaigns from kick-off through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience synthesizing program data to draft performance reports and executive-facing presentation decks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LW1 #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Axonius is committed to fair and equitable compensation packages. A candidate’s salary will be based on qualifications and relevant experience. In addition to a competitive salary, our packages include stock options, attractive benefits, and an annual bonus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range (bonus and equity included in addition to the below numbers)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$90,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Axonius:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius transforms cyber asset intelligence into actionability. With the Axonius Asset Cloud, customers preemptively tackle high-risk and hard-to-spot threat exposures, misconfigurations, and overspending. The integrated platform brings together data from every system in an organization’s IT infrastructure to optimize mission-critical risk, performance, and cost measures via actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Covering cyber assets, software, SaaS applications, identities, vulnerabilities, infrastructure, and more, Axonius is the one place to go for Security, IT, and GRC teams to continuously drive actionability across the organization. Cited as one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity startups, with accolades from CNBC, Forbes, and Fortune, Axonius supports millions of assets for leading customers across industries and around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius makes it a priority to invest in our people with competitive compensation and benefits, growth opportunities, community-building, and so much more. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers#benefits-and-perks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;benefits at Axonius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Axonius we support a diverse and inclusive workplace and believe in equal employment opportunity. We welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives&amp;nbsp;to apply. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;race, color, ancestry, religion, age, sex, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application to us, you acknowledge that your personal data will be processed in accordance&amp;nbsp;with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/global-job-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Job Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

bvp-dashlane:greenhouse:8028047.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;808&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1218&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a0c3e7b319f&quot;&gt;As a Server Software Engineer, you will own the design and implementation of core backend solutions that directly impact our business growth and partner onboarding ecosystems. You will work in a highly collaborative environment alongside Senior and Staff engineers who provide continuous mentorship, while partnering closely with product managers, project managers, and quality engineering teams. The Setup &amp;amp; Rollout team is currently focused on optimizing administrative workflows and scaling system integrations to ensure smooth deployments. Over your first 12 months, you will build full autonomy across all features and codebase areas you contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1877&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ac41ff88e19c&quot;&gt;In this role, you will combine strong backend expertise with a forward-thinking AI mindset, integrating GenAI tools throughout the &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SDLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to accelerate development velocity while working in a deeply collaborative team to secure millions of digital identities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;legacy-color-text-default&quot;&gt;Location-Specific Information:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be based in Paris, with English as your working language. At Dashlane, we embrace a hybrid culture that combines the best of both worlds: the creativity and energy of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Our model is designed to strengthen team connections while supporting individual productivity and work-life balance. To maximize collaboration, we come together in the office on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Thursdays, while Wednesdays and Fridays offer more flexibility for focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;About our tech stack:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e742daa495d5&quot;&gt;Programming languages: NodeJS, Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2324&quot; data-local-id=&quot;97f8dac8080d&quot;&gt;Infrastructure and storage layer: AWS EC2, AWS Nitro (confidential computing), Amazon &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ECS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; on &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Aurora, Redis, S3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2449&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3d490036f7c1&quot;&gt;CI/CD: Gitlab, Terraform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2477&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84031306c5e5&quot;&gt;Logging and monitoring: ELK (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana) and Datadog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2554&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fed9942a20c6&quot;&gt;AI : Claude Code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;At Dashlane you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2602&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e67eee13a22a&quot;&gt;Develop strategic third-party partner integrations and AI-assisted tools within our administrative console to drive company expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2740&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fae88452a372&quot;&gt;Pair with fellow engineers and collaborate across product, project, and quality engineering teams to deliver stable, high-impact features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2882&quot; data-local-id=&quot;700cba6b733d&quot;&gt;Modernize legacy server-side systems that handle identity management, user provisioning, and corporate onboarding workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3010&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5aac3318e791&quot;&gt;Participate in and propose cross-team initiatives aimed at improving engineering efficiency and team culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3123&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b4736c124599&quot;&gt;Continuously learn modern technologies and share technical knowledge across the organization through mentorship and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3257&quot; data-local-id=&quot;631fc35fdb67&quot;&gt;Work in a highly collaborative environment where everyone shares ownership of the company&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3361&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d8f82f491bf&quot;&gt;Participate in product and technical design discussions to define the best solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3450&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b827a7c8bfb4&quot;&gt;Implement backend projects from end-to-end: write clean code, easy to maintain and understand, implement tests, and manage deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3589&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2200387ad8ec&quot;&gt;You will lean on AI coding platforms like Claude Code to streamline this lifecycle, driving development velocity while maintaining high code quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3742&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b3bafc513847&quot;&gt;Manage the quality of our application: monitor cloud applications, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;KTLO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3818&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44087ee57bce&quot;&gt;Learn every day, and share your knowledge with your co-workers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4+ years of software development experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;3+ years of backend application development experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Node.js and TypeScript&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud infrastructure on AWS or equivalent hyperscaler&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working in agile product development teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to not only write code, but also deploy, test, and monitor cloud applications&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong commitment to application quality and security&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI Fluency: comfortable leveraging AI tools to streamline software engineering tasks and everyday workflows&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluent in English (the team is international)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3338&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Dashlane offers you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equal Parental leave - regardless of gender, up to 20 weeks fully paid leave to take care of their new baby, within the first year of birth or adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance is covered by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship program - select your mentor from our internal pool and continue your learning path!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal Vouchers (Swile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health services through Spring Health for you and your family members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 extra days off (one per quarter) to acknowledge the importance of your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot in daycare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off saving account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Donation matching program -&amp;nbsp; give back to the community and support actions that lead to positive social impact under the historically marginalized communities. Every donation will be matched by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team buildings &amp;amp; seasonal social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly lunch in the office and monthly happy hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and many more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging at Dashlane:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a truly international company—founded in France and &lt;span style=&quot;color: #172b4d;&quot;&gt;distributed across&lt;/span&gt; France, US and Portugal—Dashlane thrives off diverse perspectives. We value all aspects of diversity: gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, ethnic origin, social background, age, lifestyle, and more. We are committed to hiring a diverse community and fostering a culture where everyone is heard and belongs. See more about this &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/diversity&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;d1c12b7e-4df1-44c5-a10f-2644909c66db&quot;&gt;Your interview experience:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To know what to expect once you’ve sent your application, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read about how we interview and hire at Dashlane&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to browse our blog to find more information about our product and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

